{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intense Combat - Brutal Stealth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult members see, hear, and work as a group menace. Divide and isolate them using sound lures like bricks, bottles and scavenged items from the environment before striking.   <br>Use stealth to ambush cultists, crush them in savage melee, or unleash raw loud firepower when things fall apart.  <br>Every fight is quick, violent, and personal, no safety, no forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/0b67e0a51045f44292415db4c0022960.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/0b67e0a51045f44292415db4c0022960.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/0b67e0a51045f44292415db4c0022960.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his daughter is taken by a sadistic folk horror cult, one man sets out to hunt them to the last, through fields, barns, a decayed town and blood-soaked ritual sites,   <br>Red Season is a dark, relentless stealth\u2011action game about vengeance and sacrifice where every step closer to the truth drags you deeper into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sanity, Morality, and the Cost of Revenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/6820ed40bb2440532f90b7165b02db66.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/6820ed40bb2440532f90b7165b02db66.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/6820ed40bb2440532f90b7165b02db66.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clue  about your daughter\u2019s fate changes you.<br>Some truths heal; others hollow you out.<br>As your sanity slips, so does your sense of justice. Can you still tell if you\u2019re saving her\u2026 or just becoming another monster in the dark?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oldschool Visuals, Modern Gameplay</strong><br><strong> </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/d4c48298159b610c78589ddb0f1274ec.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/d4c48298159b610c78589ddb0f1274ec.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/d4c48298159b610c78589ddb0f1274ec.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Red Season blends retro PS1/PS2 aesthetics with modern third\u2011person controls and gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap freely between third\u2011person and first\u2011person cameras anytime during the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch shoulders to get the best angle on every shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change stances \u2014 walk, run, sprint, crouch, go prone, or crawl \u2014 to traverse the surroundings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Inspirations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Season is an ode to third\u2011person horror and shooter classics such as <i>Manhunt</i>, <i>Kane &amp; Lynch 2</i>, <i>Resident Evil 4</i>, <i>Dead Space</i>, and <i>The Last of Us</i> \u2014 while telling its own unique story of vengeance, sacrifice, and the darkness in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083140?t=1765242747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083140?t=1765242747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/d6d5d745e51a297eb9d72c4e7d09eb99f4eb546f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765242747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/d6d5d745e51a297eb9d72c4e7d09eb99f4eb546f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765242747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Red Season contains intense, realistic violence, gore, and strong language.\r\nPlayers can engage in brutal close-quarters combat and gunfights that include decapitations, dismemberment, execution-style takedowns and graphic gunshot wounds.\r\n\r\nThe game\u2019s story features a sadistic rural cult responsible for torture, ritual killings, and kidnapping. Players may encounter disturbing imagery such as corpses, bloodied environments, and victims of ritual abuse.\r\n\r\nA recurring theme in the story involves missing and kidnapped children, as well as the protagonist\u2019s personal loss.\r\n\r\nThe narrative explores dark emotional themes including grief, vengeance, and psychological trauma.\r\n\r\nInnocent hostages can be harmed or killed as a result of player actions.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual content 